# Agreement Entry into Force

This scope determines the date on which the amended agreement takes effect based on the signature date.

```catala
declaration scope AgreementEntryIntoForce:
  input signature_date content date
  output effective_date content date
```

## Entry into Force

The agreement enters into force on the day of its signature.

```catala
scope AgreementEntryIntoForce:
  date round down
  definition effective_date equals signature_date
```